  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "dee0514266c47973",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 3 Deep Think：推动科学、研究与工程进步",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b12d194cc5fbb983",
      "translationZh": "我们最专业的推理模式现已更新，以应对现代科学、研究与工程领域的挑战。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a21b58ba4c2f878a",
      "translationZh": "您的浏览器不支持音频元素。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9396d34c840bf012",
      "translationZh": "此内容由 Google AI 生成。生成式 AI 尚处于实验阶段",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a1ad48f1bd50b64d",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 3 Deep Think 迎来重大升级，旨在帮助解决科学、研究与工程领域的挑战。Google AI Ultra 订阅用户现在可以在 Gemini 应用中使用更新后的 Deep Think。研究人员、工程师和企业可以表达对抢先体验的兴趣，通过 Gemini API 测试 Deep Think。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6b43a10482221e5d",
      "translationZh": "摘要由 Google AI 生成。生成式 AI 尚处于实验阶段。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4578e62be72fdbe3",
      "translationZh": "今天，我们发布了 Gemini 3 Deep Think 的重大升级。这是我们的专业推理模式，旨在拓展智能的前沿，并解决科学、研究与工程领域的现代挑战。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "52051eec8c86bced",
      "translationZh": "我们与科学家和研究人员紧密合作，更新了 Gemini 3 Deep Think，以应对棘手的研究挑战——在这些挑战中，问题往往缺乏明确的边界约束或唯一正确的解决方案，数据也常常杂乱或不完整。通过将深厚的科学知识与日常工程实用性相结合，Deep Think 超越了抽象理论，推动实际应用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1b086c3d591e7318",
      "translationZh": "新版 Deep Think 现已在 Gemini 应用中向 Google AI Ultra 订阅用户开放，而且我们首次通过 Gemini API 向部分研究人员、工程师和企业开放 Deep Think。可在此表达提前体验的意愿。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fd9cefd71165940b",
      "translationZh": "以下是我们的早期测试者目前使用最新版 Deep Think 的方式：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "90871a1f6cc862f8",
      "translationZh": "罗格斯大学数学家 Lisa Carbone 致力于研究高能物理学界所需的数学结构，以弥合爱因斯坦引力理论与量子力学之间的鸿沟。在这个现有训练数据极少的领域，她使用 Deep Think 审阅了一篇技术性极强的数学论文。Deep Think 成功发现了一处微妙的逻辑缺陷，此前这处缺陷在人工同行评审中未被察觉。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "89425be137571680",
      "translationZh": "杜克大学的 Wang Lab 利用 Deep Think 优化复杂晶体生长的制备方法，以期发现半导体材料。Deep Think 成功设计出一套生长尺寸大于 100 μm 的薄膜的配方，达到了此前方法难以实现的精确目标。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b5f74f2f9e0d8b47",
      "translationZh": "Google 平台与设备部门的研发负责人、Liftware 前首席执行官 Anupam Pathak 测试了新版 Deep Think，以加快实体组件的设计。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e09905c293cd5eb1",
      "translationZh": "以数学和算法的严谨性提升推理能力",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7c3a4e7b19f4e82c",
      "translationZh": "去年，我们展示了 Deep Think 的专门版本能够成功应对一些最艰巨的推理挑战，在数学和编程世界锦标赛中达到金牌水平。最近，Deep Think 还让专门的智能体能够开展研究级的数学探索。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "773f7a6fa66feaca",
      "translationZh": "更新后的 Deep Think 模式继续拓展智能的前沿，在最严格的学术基准测试中达到新的高度，包括：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "598f28f613ecf289",
      "translationZh": "在 Humanity’s Last Exam 上树立新标杆（48.4%，未使用工具）；该基准旨在测试现代前沿模型的能力极限",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "51db7107138e44a0",
      "translationZh": "在 ARC-AGI-2 上取得前所未有的 84.6% 成绩，并经 ARC Prize Foundation 验证",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e42e567928d97c79",
      "translationZh": "在 Codeforces 上取得高达 3455 的 Elo 评分；该基准由编程竞赛挑战组成",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0345b8e5ec8022a4",
      "translationZh": "在 2025 年国际数学奥林匹克竞赛中达到金牌水平",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "aa835f821f16893f",
      "translationZh": "应对复杂科学领域的挑战",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6dcb886738d64bc6",
      "translationZh": "除了数学和编程竞赛，Gemini 3 Deep Think 如今在化学、物理等广泛的科学领域也表现出色。我们更新后的 Deep Think 模式在 2025 年国际物理奥林匹克竞赛和国际化学奥林匹克竞赛的笔试部分取得了金牌水平的成绩。它还展现了对高等理论物理的熟练掌握，在 CMT-Benchmark 上取得了 50.5% 的分数。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ae8f18eee7d9dab3",
      "translationZh": "加速现实世界中的工程实践",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "54940e1f73a32381",
      "translationZh": "除了具备当前最先进的性能，Deep Think 还致力于推动实际应用，让研究人员能够解读复杂数据，让工程师能够通过代码对物理系统进行建模。最重要的是，我们正在努力将 Deep Think 带到研究人员和实践者最需要它的地方——首先从 Gemini API 等使用入口开始。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "478786e093295d47",
      "translationZh": "借助更新后的 Deep Think，你可以将草图变成可通过 3D 打印实现的实物。Deep Think 会分析图纸，为复杂形状建模，并生成一个文件，用于通过 3D 打印制作实体物品。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8955924b0ebb2c45",
      "translationZh": "面向 Google AI Ultra 订阅用户开放，并通过我们的抢先体验计划在 Gemini API 中提供",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ef7d37840a325b44",
      "translationZh": "从今天起，Google AI Ultra 订阅用户将能够在 Gemini 应用中使用更新后的 Deep Think 模式。科学家、工程师和企业现在也可以表达参与我们抢先体验计划的意愿，通过 Gemini API 测试 Deep Think。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c1062de18d898c2d",
      "translationZh": "我们迫不及待地想看看你会发现什么。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fefef2f9c6cb957b",
      "translationZh": "我们在 2026 年 9 月公布的最新 AI 新闻",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "81c0514443d15d43",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 4 Argon：我们前沿智能的下一个时代",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0427f9d1d93e63e6",
      "translationZh": "我们正式推出 SynthID Bio，将我们的水印技术引入合成生物学。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4f32c94e810121bc",
      "translationZh": "观看 Future Vision XPRIZE 的获奖预告片《The Gifted》。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1dcfa6e64bf1becb",
      "translationZh": "看看 4 位开发者正在用 Gemini 3.8 Flash 打造什么",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "39afd3b78512f5a1",
      "translationZh": "推出搭载 Live Avatar 的 Gemini 3.8 Live",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8c6c3ba8ca3a0a1e",
      "translationZh": "作者：Shuo-yiin Chang 和 CJ Zheng",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
